            important for correct relative loss comparisons. It is only
            computed when compute_full_loss == True. ]
      = x - z * log(x) [+ z * log(z) - z + 0.5 * log(2 * pi * z)]
      = exp(c) - z * c [+ z * log(z) - z + 0.5 * log(2 * pi * z)]

